{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser","level":"A2","topic":"Artikel","title":{"de":"welcher? und dieser","bn":"welcher? — কোনটি? আর dieser — এইটি"},"summary":"কোনটি জানতে welcher?, দেখিয়ে বলতে dieser; শেষটা der/die/das-এর মতো বদলায়।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"দোকানে আমরা বলি: „কোন জামাটা?“ – „এই জামাটা।“ জার্মানে এর জন্য welcher? (কোনটি?) আর dieser (এইটি) ব্যবহার হয়।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"১. welcher? — কোনটি?","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Welcher Bus fährt zum Bahnhof?","bn":"কোন বাসটি স্টেশনে যায়?"},{"de":"Welche Farbe magst du?","bn":"তুমি কোন রং পছন্দ করো?"},{"de":"Welches Buch liest du?","bn":"তুমি কোন বইটি পড়ছ?"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"welch-এর শেষটা der / die / das অনুযায়ী বদলায়:"},{"kind":"table","rows":[["","der","die","das","Plural"],["কোনটি?","welcher","welche","welches","welche"],["এইটি","dieser","diese","dieses","diese"]]},{"kind":"text","text":"মনে রাখার কৌশল: der → welcher (শেষে -r), die → welche (-e), das → welches (-s)।"}]},{"heading":"২. dieser — এইটি","blocks":[{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Dieser Pullover ist zu teuer.","bn":"এই সোয়েটারটি খুব দামি।"},{"de":"Diese Jacke gefällt mir.","bn":"এই জ্যাকেটটি আমার ভালো লাগে।"},{"de":"Dieses Hotel ist sehr schön.","bn":"এই হোটেলটি খুব সুন্দর।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"Akkusativ-এ masculine শব্দে শেষে -en হয় (den-এর মতো):"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Welchen Film möchtest du sehen? – Diesen Film.","bn":"তুমি কোন সিনেমাটি দেখতে চাও? – এই সিনেমাটি।"},{"de":"Ich nehme diesen Rock.","bn":"আমি এই স্কার্টটি নেব।"}]}]}],"test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Bus fährt zum Bahnhof? (der Bus)","options":["Welche","Welcher","Welches"],"answer":1,"explanation":"der → welcher।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Jacke gefällt mir. (die Jacke)","options":["Diese","Dieser","Dieses"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die → diese।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Hotel ist sehr schön. (das Hotel)","options":["Dieser","Diese","Dieses"],"answer":2,"explanation":"das → dieses।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„welcher“ মানে কী?","options":["কে","কোনটি","কখন"],"answer":1,"explanation":"welcher = কোনটি।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich nehme ___ Rock. (der Rock, Akkusativ)","options":["dieser","diesen","diesem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ-এ masculine: den → diesen।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Dieser Pullover ist zu teuer.“ মানে কী?","options":["এই সোয়েটারটি খুব দামি।","কোন সোয়েটারটি দামি?","সোয়েটারটি সস্তা।"],"answer":0,"explanation":"dieser = এই।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser","level":"A2","test":[{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Bus fährt zum Bahnhof? (der Bus)","options":["Welche","Welcher","Welches"],"answer":1,"explanation":"der → welcher।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Jacke gefällt mir. (die Jacke)","options":["Diese","Dieser","Dieses"],"answer":0,"explanation":"die → diese।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"___ Hotel ist sehr schön. (das Hotel)","options":["Dieser","Diese","Dieses"],"answer":2,"explanation":"das → dieses।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"„welcher“ মানে কী?","options":["কে","কোনটি","কখন"],"answer":1,"explanation":"welcher = কোনটি।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich nehme ___ Rock. (der Rock, Akkusativ)","options":["dieser","diesen","diesem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ-এ masculine: den → diesen।"},{"id":"a2-grammar-welcher-dieser-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Dieser Pullover ist zu teuer.“ মানে কী?","options":["এই সোয়েটারটি খুব দামি।","কোন সোয়েটারটি দামি?","সোয়েটারটি সস্তা।"],"answer":0,"explanation":"dieser = এই।"}]}